---
/**
 * System chart for the ClassLista agent team.
 *
 * Wide screens: six stage columns, labeled handoffs, a shared-state
 * hub under plan / build / verify, a two-way Grok–Claude docs link
 * on that hub, and a feedback arrow back to plan.
 * Narrow screens: the same stages stacked, with full-size type.
 * Colors come from the site tokens so light and dark both apply.
 */
---

<figure class="agent-arch not-prose my-8" aria-labelledby="agent-arch-caption">
  <figcaption id="agent-arch-caption" class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-accent uppercase">
    How the work moves
  </figcaption>
  <p class="sr-only">
    Six stages, in order: Decide, Plan and coordinate, Build, Verify, Ship and operate, Learn and publish. On a
    wide screen the stages are columns. On a phone they stack. Labeled arrows mark the handoffs: priorities, then
    brief, then pull request, then merged, then shipped. A solid two-way link between Grok and Claude is labeled
    shared handoff docs: inboxes, status board, decisions log. It sits on the shared-state hub, with a protocol
    guide and handoff templates. AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md tell every agent to read its inbox and the status board
    at the start of a session and to update them at the end. Grok keeps a local synced checkout of the same files.
    Ziyong sets direction and approves production, money, deletes, auth, and merges. Shared state also holds the
    repository, the roadmap, and the backlog, and it connects plan, build, and verify. A feedback arrow runs from
    ship and learn back to plan, because production checks and audits feed the backlog. A smaller side lane holds
    other assistants, for email triage and AI news, and the in-app assistant inside the product. That assistant
    defaults to Grok. OpenAI or Anthropic are optional. It is read-only and role-scoped.
  </p>

  <div class="board">
    <ol class="stages">
      <li class="stage stage-decide">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">01</span> Me</p>
          <p class="title">Decide</p>
          <p class="role">Ziyong · approver</p>
          <p class="body">I set direction. I approve production, money, deletes, auth, and merges.</p>
        </article>
        <p class="handoff">
          <svg class="arrow-down" viewBox="0 0 16 22" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2v14M3.5 11.5 8 17.5 12.5 11.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg class="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 34 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 6h26M22 1.5 30.5 6 22 10.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Handoff to plan. </span>priorities</span>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="stage stage-plan">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">02</span> Grok</p>
          <p class="title">Plan &amp; coordinate</p>
          <p class="role">Grok Bot for ClassLista</p>
          <p class="body">Backlog, briefs, and plan review. Launches the builders.</p>
          <p class="note">Claude drafts the living roadmap.</p>
        </article>
        <p class="handoff">
          <svg class="arrow-down" viewBox="0 0 16 22" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2v14M3.5 11.5 8 17.5 12.5 11.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg class="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 34 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 6h26M22 1.5 30.5 6 22 10.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Handoff to the builders. </span>brief</span>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="stage stage-build">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">03</span> Builders</p>
          <p class="title">Build</p>
          <p class="role">Parallel, one change each</p>
          <div class="split">
            <div class="lane">
              <p class="mini">Cursor</p>
              <p class="body">Cloud agents. First version and the security lockdown.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lane">
              <p class="mini">Claude Code</p>
              <p class="body">In the cloud. Main feature builder.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="note">Own branch, then a small pull request.</p>
        </article>
        <p class="handoff">
          <svg class="arrow-down" viewBox="0 0 16 22" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2v14M3.5 11.5 8 17.5 12.5 11.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg class="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 34 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 6h26M22 1.5 30.5 6 22 10.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Handoff to verify. </span>pull request</span>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="stage stage-verify">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">04</span> Gates</p>
          <p class="title">Verify</p>
          <p class="role">Automated, then me</p>
          <ul class="gates">
            <li>GitHub Actions CI: typecheck, tests, build</li>
            <li>ESLint and Prettier</li>
            <li>Dependabot updates</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="note">Then my review and merge.</p>
        </article>
        <p class="handoff">
          <svg class="arrow-down" viewBox="0 0 16 22" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2v14M3.5 11.5 8 17.5 12.5 11.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg class="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 34 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 6h26M22 1.5 30.5 6 22 10.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Handoff to ship. </span>merged</span>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="stage stage-ship">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">05</span> Railway</p>
          <p class="title">Ship &amp; operate</p>
          <p class="role">classlista.com</p>
          <p class="body">Docker deploy. Grok checks production, and handles domain, DNS, and email through Resend.</p>
        </article>
        <p class="handoff">
          <svg class="arrow-down" viewBox="0 0 16 22" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2v14M3.5 11.5 8 17.5 12.5 11.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg class="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 34 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 6h26M22 1.5 30.5 6 22 10.5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Handoff to learn. </span>shipped</span>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="stage stage-learn">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="num">06</span> Publish</p>
          <p class="title">Learn &amp; publish</p>
          <p class="role">After it ships</p>
          <p class="body">Grok audits what shipped and fixes drift, such as stale docs.</p>
          <p class="note">A website assistant turns a two-week handoff into this page.</p>
        </article>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="links" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="bridge">
        <span class="bridge-v bridge-v-l"></span>
        <span class="bridge-v bridge-v-r"></span>
        <span class="bridge-h"></span>
        <svg class="bridge-ah bridge-ah-l" viewBox="0 0 12 12">
          <path d="M9 1.5 3 6l6 4.5"></path>
        </svg>
        <svg class="bridge-ah bridge-ah-r" viewBox="0 0 12 12">
          <path d="M3 1.5 9 6 3 10.5"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="stems">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hub">
      <div class="pair">
        <p class="pair-dir">
          <svg class="pair-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 16" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 8h48M8 8l7-5M8 8l7 5M56 8l-7-5M56 8l-7 5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span><span class="sr-only">Two-way link. </span>Grok and Claude</span>
        </p>
        <p class="pair-label">Shared handoff docs: inboxes, status board, decisions log.</p>
        <p class="pair-note">Protocol guide and handoff templates.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="kicker">Shared state · plan, build, verify</p>
      <ul class="hub-items">
        <li>
          <span class="mini">Repository</span>
          <span class="body">Grok keeps a local synced checkout and reads and writes these files.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mini">AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md</span>
          <span class="body">For anyone changing this code, human or AI tool. Read the inbox and the status board at the start. Update them at the end.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mini">Roadmap</span>
          <span class="body">The living product roadmap.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mini">Backlog</span>
          <span class="body">Briefs and the next change.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="loop">
      <span class="loop-icon" aria-hidden="true">↺</span>
      <span class="loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><span class="loop-head"></span><span class="loop-rule"></span></span>
      <span class="loop-copy">
        <span class="kicker">Back to Plan</span>
        <span class="body">Production checks and audits feed the backlog.</span>
      </span>
    </p>

    <aside class="side" aria-label="Side lane">
      <p class="kicker">Side lane</p>
      <div class="side-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="role">Other assistants</p>
          <p class="body">Email triage and AI news. They keep my attention on product.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="role">In-app assistant</p>
          <p class="body">Inside the product. Grok by default. OpenAI or Anthropic optional. Read-only and role-scoped.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .agent-arch {
    container-name: arch;
    container-type: inline-size;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  /* On a wide viewport the chart leaves the narrow article column. */
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .agent-arch {
      width: min(72rem, calc(100vw - 4rem));
      max-width: none;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  .board {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .stages {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 1rem 1rem 0.95rem;
  }

  .kicker,
  .mini,
  .handoff,
  .via-tag,
  .via-note span,
  .loop-copy .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .kicker {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .title {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .role {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .body,
  .note,
  .gates,
  .via-note {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .note {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .mini {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .lane {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .lane .body {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .gates {
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .gates li {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 0.28rem;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gates li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.45em;
    left: 0;
    width: 0.32rem;
    height: 0.32rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .stage-decide .card,
  .stage-learn .card {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .stage-plan .card,
  .stage-ship .card {
    background: var(--highlight-soft);
  }

  .stage-plan .kicker,
  .stage-ship .kicker {
    color: var(--highlight);
  }

  .stage-build .card {
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .stage-verify .card {
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .stage-build .kicker,
  .stage-verify .kicker {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .handoff {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem 0.55rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .arrow-down,
  .arrow-right {
    display: block;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .arrow-down {
    width: 14px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .arrow-right {
    display: none;
  }

  .links {
    display: none;
  }

  .pair {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.7rem 0.7rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--highlight);
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .pair-dir {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--highlight);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pair-icon {
    display: block;
    flex: none;
    width: 64px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .pair-icon path,
  .bridge-ah path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .pair-label {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .pair-note {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .hub {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .hub .title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .hub-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .hub-items li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.12rem;
  }

  .loop {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--highlight-soft);
    color: var(--highlight);
  }

  .loop-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .loop-arrow {
    display: none;
  }

  .loop-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .loop-copy .kicker {
    color: var(--highlight);
  }

  .loop-copy .body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .side {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .side .kicker {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .side-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .side .role {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .side .body {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  @container arch (min-width: 520px) and (max-width: 1019px) {
    .split,
    .hub-items,
    .side-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @container arch (min-width: 1020px) {
    .board {
      overflow: visible;
      padding: 0.85rem 0.7rem 0.8rem;
    }

    .stages {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: 0.45rem;
      row-gap: 0;
    }

    .stages::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.62rem;
      left: calc(100% / 12);
      right: calc(100% / 12);
      z-index: 0;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .stage {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 1.7rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .card {
      grid-row: 2;
      height: 100%;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.5rem 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 1rem;
    }

    .stage-verify .card {
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .kicker {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .num {
      display: inline-grid;
      flex: none;
      place-items: center;
      width: 1.35rem;
      height: 1.35rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--card);
    }

    .title {
      min-height: 2.35em;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .role,
    .body,
    .note,
    .gates {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .role {
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    .handoff {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      grid-row: 1;
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-self: end;
      width: max-content;
      max-width: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.08rem 0.32rem;
      transform: translateX(calc(50% + 0.22rem));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--card);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .arrow-down {
      display: none;
    }

    .arrow-right {
      display: block;
      width: 22px;
      height: 9px;
    }

    .links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      grid-template-rows: 1.35rem 0.7rem;
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .bridge {
      position: relative;
      grid-column: 2 / 4;
      grid-row: 1 / 3;
      color: var(--highlight);
    }

    .bridge-v,
    .bridge-h {
      position: absolute;
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .bridge-v {
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
    }

    .bridge-v-l {
      left: 25%;
      margin-left: -1px;
    }

    .bridge-v-r {
      left: 75%;
      margin-left: -1px;
    }

    .bridge-h {
      top: 42%;
      right: calc(25% + 8px);
      left: calc(25% + 8px);
      height: 2px;
    }

    .bridge-ah {
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(42% - 6px);
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
    }

    .bridge-ah-l {
      left: calc(25% - 1px);
    }

    .bridge-ah-r {
      left: calc(75% - 11px);
    }

    .pair-icon {
      display: none;
    }

    .pair {
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.45rem 0.45rem;
    }

    .pair-dir {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
    }

    .pair-label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .pair-note {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    .stems {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      grid-column: 2 / 5;
      grid-row: 2;
      height: 0.85rem;
    }

    .stems span {
      justify-self: center;
      width: 2px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--highlight);
    }

    .stems span:nth-child(-n + 2) {
      background: transparent;
    }

    .hub {
      grid-column: 2 / 5;
      margin-top: -1px;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem 0.65rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--highlight);
      border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem;
      background: var(--highlight-soft);
    }

    .hub .kicker {
      color: var(--highlight);
      font-size: 0.58rem;
    }

    .hub .title {
      min-height: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .hub-items {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.4rem 0.55rem;
      margin-top: 0.45rem;
    }

    .via-note {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .loop {
      display: block;
      grid-column: 2 / 7;
      margin-top: 0.55rem;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .loop-icon {
      display: none;
    }

    .loop-arrow {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--highlight);
    }

    .loop-head {
      flex: none;
      width: 0.48rem;
      height: 0.48rem;
      margin-right: -0.12rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--highlight);
      border-left: 2px solid var(--highlight);
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .loop-rule {
      flex: 1;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--highlight);
    }

    .loop-copy {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
      margin-top: 0.28rem;
    }

    .side {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      margin-top: 0.7rem;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .side-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.35rem 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .side .role,
    .side .body {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
